  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34674538",
      "title": "Fetching Data for Dynamic Routes",
      "lectureOrder": 30,
      "videoOrder": 26,
      "sourceHash": "8b3321680cb4d0a949cbc954ad0294fae654772cc7458564c2ce249bef08aaec",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.19,
          "end": 5.64,
          "en": "To load the data for the note details page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.64,
          "end": 8.97,
          "en": "we bring back another function which we saw before already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.97,
          "end": 12.72,
          "en": "the loader function, because that's the function you need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.72,
          "end": 16.02,
          "en": "to load data for a component on the back-end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.02,
          "end": 17.67,
          "en": "which is what we want to do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.75,
          "end": 21.18,
          "en": "Again, Remix will execute this automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.18,
          "end": 23.04,
          "en": "when we try to load this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.04,
          "end": 27.48,
          "en": "And in here, we now wanna reach out to our notes.json file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.48,
          "end": 30.66,
          "en": "and fetch the right note for this website here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.66,
          "end": 32.403,
          "en": "For this page here, I mean.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.87,
          "end": 37.38,
          "en": "For this, I use this getStoredNotes helper function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.38,
          "end": 39.78,
          "en": "which is imported from data notes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.78,
          "end": 43.323,
          "en": "So from this notes.js file here in the data folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.46,
          "end": 47.13,
          "en": "And as you learned before, this returns a promise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.13,
          "end": 52.13,
          "en": "so I will use async await here, and then we get our notes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.2,
          "end": 54.273,
          "en": "But here of course, we get all notes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.14,
          "end": 56.7,
          "en": "Now if this would be a real database,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.7,
          "end": 59.16,
          "en": "there would probably be a dedicated function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.16,
          "end": 61.98,
          "en": "for just fetching a single entry from the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.98,
          "end": 65.55,
          "en": "Here, I'm instead fetching all entries from that file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.55,
          "end": 70.41,
          "en": "And now I wanna find the selected note by going to my notes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.41,
          "end": 74.28,
          "en": "and I can use the find method, a default JavaScript method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.28,
          "end": 78.33,
          "en": "that exists on arrays to find the note",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.33,
          "end": 83.33,
          "en": "where the ID is equal to the ID that's part of the URL here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.42,
          "end": 87.483,
          "en": "But how do we get hold of that ID in that loader?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 88.86,
          "end": 92.793,
          "en": "Well, just like the action function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 94.02000000000001,
          "end": 97.71000000000001,
          "en": "this loader function also receives a data object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 97.71000000000001,
          "end": 100.53,
          "en": "passed in by Remix automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 100.53,
          "end": 103.32,
          "en": "And this object also has a request property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 103.32,
          "end": 106.56,
          "en": "with details about the get request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 106.56,
          "end": 108.6,
          "en": "But more importantly for us here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 108.6,
          "end": 110.467,
          "en": "it also has a params property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 110.467,
          "end": 114.09,
          "en": "with information about the dynamic route parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 114.09,
          "end": 118.71000000000001,
          "en": "So these dynamic path segments like this ID here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 118.71000000000001,
          "end": 120.75,
          "en": "So basically, if you have a dollar sign here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 120.75,
          "end": 123.84,
          "en": "in the route file name, it's the part after the dollar sign",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 123.84,
          "end": 126.15,
          "en": "that's part of this params object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 126.15,
          "end": 130.23,
          "en": "This placeholder can be used for accessing the actual value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 130.23,
          "end": 134.07,
          "en": "that's stored for this placeholder in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 134.07,
          "end": 136.8,
          "en": "By the way, this params object is also available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.8,
          "end": 139.26,
          "en": "in an action if you would need it there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139.26,
          "end": 140.16,
          "en": "Here we don't,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.16,
          "end": 143.43,
          "en": "but if you had an action that also runs for a page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.43,
          "end": 145.74,
          "en": "that has some dynamic path segment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.74,
          "end": 148.17000000000002,
          "en": "you would get access to the params object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.17000000000002,
          "end": 149.463,
          "en": "on actions as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.93,
          "end": 152.85,
          "en": "But here we need it for the loader.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.85,
          "end": 154.59,
          "en": "I'm using object destructuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 154.59,
          "end": 157.29,
          "en": "for getting hold of this params object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.29,
          "end": 161.16,
          "en": "And then here, I know that my note ID can be found",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.16,
          "end": 165.54,
          "en": "on params.noteId, and it's noteId here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.54,
          "end": 169.293,
          "en": "because I chose noteId here after the dollar sign.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 171.57,
          "end": 175.29,
          "en": "If you chose a different identifier after the dollar sign,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 175.29,
          "end": 178.053,
          "en": "you must use a different identifier here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 179.46,
          "end": 181.05,
          "en": "For me, it's noteId though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 181.05,
          "end": 183.72,
          "en": "and therefore here in this check down there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 183.72,
          "end": 187.5,
          "en": "I check whether I find a note which has an ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 187.5,
          "end": 190.683,
          "en": "that is equal to that noteId that's part of my URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 191.52,
          "end": 193.38,
          "en": "and then I try to return that note",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 193.38,
          "end": 195.033,
          "en": "and store it in this constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 195.9,
          "end": 197.34,
          "en": "Therefore, then I can return",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 197.34,
          "end": 199.383,
          "en": "this selected note in my loader.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.52,
          "end": 203.07,
          "en": "And in the note details page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 203.07,
          "end": 206.52,
          "en": "we again get access to that data with useLoaderData,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 206.52,
          "end": 209.193,
          "en": "which is imported from Remix run React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 210.84,
          "end": 214.07999999999998,
          "en": "So here I get my note, and now we can output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 214.07999999999998,
          "end": 218.94299999999998,
          "en": "the note title by accessing note.title, just like that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 220.17000000000002,
          "end": 224.66,
          "en": "add the content by accessing note.content, like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 229.07999999999998,
          "end": 230.7,
          "en": "And with that, if we reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 230.7,
          "end": 233.67000000000002,
          "en": "you see I have some concrete data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 233.67000000000002,
          "end": 237.3,
          "en": "If I click on the second note with Remix is awesome,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 237.3,
          "end": 239.64,
          "en": "I see that here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 239.64,
          "end": 241.53,
          "en": "So that's how we can fetch dynamic data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 241.53,
          "end": 245.583,
          "en": "for dynamic routes that have dynamic values in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
